          "description": "Musical Tales of Nature is a series of original stories about natural wonders, where each tale is paired with classical music carefully chosen to match the musical rhythm and story flow. These tales teach children to listen and feel classical music, opening tiny windows into nature’s secrets like how is wind or rainbow created. They also help children understand connections between things, and develop emotional intelligence, imagination, and language — through the harmony of sound and story",
